    ["Gathers everyone's /roll. /fgui rolls shows them highest first and names the winner; only 1-100 and a player's first roll count."] = "Reúne las /roll de todos. /fgui rolls las muestra de mayor a menor y nombra al ganador; solo cuentan 1-100 y la primera tirada.",
    ["Gathers other add-ons' minimap buttons into one fold-out panel."] = "Reúne los botones del minimapa de otros accesorios en un panel desplegable.",
    ["Gathers what is needed to look into a problem - what is running, any errors, the settings you changed and your other add-ons - into text you can copy. Nothing is sent by itself: add-ons have no access to the internet."] = "Reúne lo necesario para investigar un problema (lo que se ejecuta, errores, los ajustes que cambiaste y tus otros addons) en un texto para copiar. No se envía nada solo: los addons no tienen acceso a internet.",
    ["gave"] = "dio",
