    ["Setup finished. Everything is in |cffffff00/fgui|r whenever you want to change it."] = "Configuración terminada. Todo está en |cffffff00/fgui|r cuando quieras cambiarlo.",
    ["Shadows, liquid detail, particle density and a few other costly settings are turned down while you are inside a raid and put back when you leave."] = "Las sombras, el detalle de líquidos, la densidad de partículas y otros ajustes costosos se reducen dentro de una banda y se restauran al salir.",
    ["Share"] = "Compartir",
