    ["Read talk and quests aloud: what an NPC says, a quest's text and a book are read as they open. Read what I point at: a tooltip is read when the mouse rests on it."] = "朗读对话和任务：NPC 的话、任务文本和书籍在打开时朗读。朗读我指向的内容：鼠标停留时朗读提示。",
    ["Move through the game's windows with the keyboard: in NPC talk, quests, vendors, mail, loot and question boxes, Tab goes from button to button and Enter presses, with each choice said aloud if you like."] = "用键盘在游戏窗口中移动：在 NPC 对话、任务、商人、邮件、拾取和询问框中，Tab 在按钮间移动，回车按下，并可读出每个选项。",
    ["Keys for one hand: everything round W, A, S and D, or all on the number pad, with one button, and one to put your keys back (/fgui keys)."] = "单手按键：一键把所有操作放在 W、A、S、D 周围或数字小键盘上，另一键恢复你的按键（/fgui keys）。",
    ["A celestial High contrast theme, and one button for the high-contrast theme of the family you use (/fgui contrast)."] = "星空高对比度主题，以及一键使用你所用系列的高对比度主题（/fgui contrast）。",
    ["Still sky: the stars stay and the motion goes. And a wait before tooltips show, for a calmer screen."] = "静止星空：星星留下，动效消失。另有提示出现前的等待，让屏幕更安静。",
    ["A new look for the settings window: calm and dark whatever your theme, with only your theme's accent color showing through, and clear lettering."] = "设置窗口焕然一新：无论用哪个主题都沉静、深色，只显示主题的强调色，字体清晰。",
    ["Settings sit in cards with a switch on each, and the list of categories down the left is tidier."] = "设置放在卡片里，每张卡片都有开关，左侧的分类列表也更整洁。",
    ["Themes are shown as a grid of pictures, with a large preview beside it."] = "主题以图片网格显示，旁边有大幅预览。",
    ["High-contrast themes give the window a black-and-white version, and the Readable and Dyslexia-friendly lettering still apply."] = "高对比度主题会让窗口变成黑白版本，易读和适合阅读障碍字体仍然适用。",
    ["Choices"] = "选项",
    ["%s, %d of %d"] = "%s，第 %d 个，共 %d 个",
    ["Use the high-contrast theme"] = "使用高对比度主题",
    ["Pure black panels, white lettering and the strongest rims, in the family you use: glass, fantasy or celestial."] = "在你使用的系列（玻璃、奇幻或星空）中：纯黑面板、白色文字和最醒目的边框。",
    ["Still sky"] = "静止星空",
    ["The celestial sky keeps its stars but holds still: no twinkling, no breathing light, no shooting stars. Everything else moves as usual."] = "星空保留星星但保持静止：不闪烁、没有呼吸般的光、没有流星。其他一切照常运动。",
    ["Wait before a tooltip shows (ms)"] = "提示信息出现前等待（毫秒）",
    ["How long the mouse must rest on something before its tooltip shows, so sweeping across the screen does not throw one up after another. 0 shows them at once."] = "鼠标需在某物上停留多久才显示其提示，这样扫过屏幕时不会接连弹出。0 为立即显示。",
    ["Read talk and quests aloud"] = "朗读对话和任务",
    ["What an NPC says (and the choices), a quest's text and a book or letter are read as soon as they open, and the reading stops when you close them."] = "NPC 的话（及选项）、任务文本以及书籍或信件会在打开时立即朗读，关闭时停止。",
    ["Read what I point at"] = "朗读我指向的内容",
    ["When the mouse rests on something for half a second, its tooltip is read aloud. The game's own screen narrator only works before you log in."] = "鼠标在某物上停留半秒时，会朗读其提示。游戏自带的屏幕朗读只在登录前有效。",
    ["Move through the game's windows with the keyboard"] = "用键盘在游戏窗口中移动",
    ["With an NPC's talk, a quest, a vendor, the mailbox, loot, a trainer, a flight master or a question box open: Tab or Down goes to the next thing to press, Shift+Tab or Up to the one before, Enter or Space presses it. A ring shows where you are. Never while you type, and not in a fight."] = "当 NPC 对话、任务、商人、邮箱、拾取、训练师、飞行管理员或询问框打开时：Tab 或下方向键到下一个，Shift+Tab 或上方向键到上一个，回车或空格按下它。圆环显示你的位置。输入文字时和战斗中不生效。",
    ["Say each choice as I reach it"] = "到达每个选项时读出它",
    ["With the keyboard in the game's windows: each button is said aloud as the ring reaches it, with where it is in the list."] = "在游戏窗口中使用键盘时：圆环到达每个按钮时都会读出它及其在列表中的位置。",
    ["Keys for the left hand only"] = "仅左手按键",
    ["Moving on W, A, S and D, strafing on Q and E, jumping on Space, the first twelve action buttons on 1 to 5 and the keys round them, Tab to target and F to interact. The keys these take are noted, to be put back."] = "W、A、S、D 移动，Q 和 E 平移，空格跳跃，前十二个动作按钮在 1 到 5 及周围按键上，Tab 选择目标，F 互动。被占用的按键会被记下，以便恢复。",
    ["Keys for the number pad only"] = "仅数字小键盘按键",
    ["Everything on the number pad, for the right hand: 8, 5, 4 and 6 move and turn, 7 and 9 strafe, 0 jumps, 1, 2, 3, / , * and - are the first six action buttons, + targets and . interacts."] = "全部在数字小键盘上，供右手使用：8、5、4、6 移动和转向，7 和 9 平移，0 跳跃，1、2、3、/、*、- 是前六个动作按钮，+ 选择目标，. 互动。",
    ["Put my keys back"] = "恢复我的按键",
    ["Every key a one-hand set took goes back to what it did before."] = "单手按键方案占用的每个按键都恢复原先的功能。",
    ["Keys can't be changed during a fight: try again after it."] = "战斗中不能更改按键：请在战斗结束后再试。",
    ["%d keys set for one hand. \"Put my keys back\" returns them as they were."] = "已为单手设置 %d 个按键。“恢复我的按键”可将其还原。",
    ["Your keys are as they were."] = "你的按键保持原样。",
    ["%d keys put back as they were."] = "已恢复 %d 个按键。",
    ["keys for one hand: round W, A, S and D, or all on the number pad; back puts your keys as they were"] = "单手按键：在 W、A、S、D 周围，或全部在数字小键盘上；back 恢复你的按键",
    ["the high-contrast theme of the family you use"] = "你所用系列的高对比度主题",
    ["Celestial: High contrast (black sky, white stars)"] = "星空：高对比度（黑色天空，白色星星）",
    ["Made for WoW: Forever alone: everything the add-on calls is the game's own. Talent builds use Forever's loadouts, and the talent set buttons, pet happiness and debuff colors now show."] = "专为 WoW: Forever 打造：插件调用的一切都是游戏自身的功能。天赋方案使用 Forever 的天赋配置，天赋组按钮、宠物快乐度和减益效果颜色现在都会显示。",
    ["Talent build saved: %s."] = "天赋方案已保存：%s。",
    ["The game gave no talents to save. Open your talents once, then try again."] = "游戏没有提供可保存的天赋。请先打开一次天赋界面，然后再试。",
    ["%s: press Import in the talent window, then choose it from your loadouts."] = "%s：在天赋窗口中点击“导入”，然后从你的天赋配置中选择它。",
    ["In the talent window, choose Import and paste this build's code."] = "在天赋窗口中选择“导入”，然后粘贴此方案的代码。",
    ["Click: put this build in the game's Import box. Right-click: delete it."] = "点击：把此方案放入游戏的导入框。右键：删除。",
    ["No builds yet: choose your talents, then /fgui talents save <name>."] = "还没有方案：先选好天赋，然后输入 /fgui talents save <名称>。",
    ["Type a name to keep the talents you have now. Use puts a build in the game's Import box: press Import there and it joins your loadouts. /fgui talents send <player> <build> sends one."] = "输入名称以保存当前天赋。“使用”会把方案放入游戏的导入框：在那里点击“导入”，它就会加入你的天赋配置。/fgui talents send <玩家> <方案> 可发送方案。",
    ["keep your talents as a build; /fgui talents lists them, click one to import it"] = "将天赋保存为方案；/fgui talents 列出它们，点击即可导入",
    ["WoW Forever does not let add-ons send messages to other players here. Try again outside the instance."] = "WoW Forever 不允许插件在这里向其他玩家发送消息。请在副本外再试。",
    ["Accessibility is a category of its own in the settings, with Seeing, Hearing, Flashing and motion, Focus and calm, Reading aloud, Hands and keys, and Share, and a Comfort step in the setup."] = "辅助功能成为设置中的独立类别，包含视觉、听觉、闪烁与动效、专注与平静、朗读、手与按键和分享；设置向导也新增了“舒适”一步。",
    ["Color vision for each kind: red-green, blue-yellow, or no color at all, where brightness and marks carry the meaning. Threat on nameplates gets a mark too, and your target can have a thick outline."] = "按色觉类型设置：红绿、蓝黄，或完全无色（用亮度和标记表达含义）。姓名板上的仇恨也有标记，你的目标可以加粗描边。",
    ["Captions for sounds: a line on screen for ready checks, whispers, queues, invites, boss emotes, raid warnings, loot rolls and your alerts. And a key that reads aloud the tooltip, the quest or the last whisper."] = "声音字幕：就位确认、密语、排队、邀请、首领表情、团队警告、拾取掷骰和你的提示都会在屏幕上显示一行字。还新增了朗读提示、任务或最后一条密语的按键。",
    ["Two lettering styles made to be read: Readable (Atkinson Hyperlegible) and Dyslexia-friendly (OpenDyslexic), with a thicker outline round letters and a dark band behind messages if you want them."] = "两种为阅读而设计的字体：易读（Atkinson Hyperlegible）和适合阅读障碍（OpenDyslexic），还可以选择更粗的文字描边和消息后的深色底。",
    ["Safe flashing, Calm mode, bigger controls, moving through the settings with the keyboard, and your accessibility settings as one line to share."] = "安全闪烁、平静模式、更大的控件、用键盘浏览设置，以及把辅助功能设置变成一行来分享。",
    ["Seeing"] = "视觉",
    ["Hearing"] = "听觉",
    ["Flashing and motion"] = "闪烁与动效",
    ["Focus and calm"] = "专注与平静",
    ["Reading aloud"] = "朗读",
    ["Hands and keys"] = "手与按键",
    ["Seeing, hearing, flashing, calm, reading aloud and the keyboard."] = "视觉、听觉、闪烁、平静、朗读和键盘。",
    ["Themes, accent, lettering, the game's windows and sounds."] = "主题、强调色、字体、游戏窗口和声音。",
    ["Contrast and text size"] = "对比度与文字大小",
    ["Good and bad are shown in colors chosen for your kind of color vision (below), debuffs get a letter, item quality gets dots, and threat gets a mark."] = "好与坏会以适合你色觉类型（下方选择）的颜色显示，减益带字母，物品品质带圆点，仇恨带标记。",
    ["Color vision"] = "色觉",
    ["Red-green"] = "红绿",
    ["Blue-yellow"] = "蓝黄",
    ["No color"] = "无色",
    ["Usual colors"] = "常规颜色",
    ["Red-green: the most common, blue and orange. Blue-yellow: teal, pink and red. No color: brightness and marks only."] = "红绿：最常见，蓝与橙。蓝黄：青、粉与红。无色：仅用亮度和标记。",
    ["Readable lettering"] = "易读字体",
    ["As chosen"] = "保持所选",
    ["Readable"] = "易读",
    ["Dyslexia-friendly"] = "适合阅读障碍",
    ["Readable: Atkinson Hyperlegible, made for low vision. Dyslexia-friendly: OpenDyslexic, with weighted letters that are hard to flip. Western European letters only."] = "易读：Atkinson Hyperlegible，为低视力设计。适合阅读障碍：OpenDyslexic，字母底部加重，不易混淆。仅支持西欧字母。",
    ["Outline round letters"] = "文字描边",
    ["As the lettering has it"] = "沿用字体",
    ["Thin"] = "细",
    ["Thick"] = "粗",
    ["A dark outline round every letter, so text stands out from what is behind it."] = "每个字母加深色描边，让文字从背景中突出。",
    ["Dark band behind messages"] = "消息后加深色底",
    ["Messages in the middle of the screen sit on a dark band, so they read over anything."] = "屏幕中间的消息显示在深色底上，任何背景下都能看清。",
    ["Outline round my target (pixels)"] = "目标描边（像素）",
    ["A thick ring round your target's nameplate, so it stands out in a crowd. 0 is off. Shows on the next target you pick."] = "在目标姓名板外加一圈粗边，在人群中也显眼。0 为关闭。下次选择目标时生效。",
    ["Safe flashing"] = "安全闪烁",
    ["Nothing flashes more than three times a second, flashes are gentle, pulsing warnings hold still, and the game's red low-health flash is off where this client allows it."] = "每秒闪烁不超过三次，闪光柔和，跳动的警告保持静止，并在客户端允许时关闭低血量红色闪烁。",
    ["Calm mode"] = "平静模式",
    ["One notification at a time, held for fifteen seconds and put away with a click; messages stay up longer; captions wait their turn."] = "一次只显示一条通知，停留十五秒，点击即收起；消息停留更久；字幕依次显示。",
    ["Bigger controls in the settings"] = "设置中使用更大的控件",
    ["Larger switches and lines in this window, and \"click twice\" buttons wait ten seconds for the second click."] = "本窗口中的开关和行更大，“点击两次”的按钮会等待十秒。",
    ["Move through the settings with the keyboard"] = "用键盘浏览设置",
    ["Tab or the arrow keys go from setting to setting, Space or Enter switches one, Left and Right move a slider, Page Up and Page Down change section. While this window is open, those keys do nothing else."] = "Tab 或方向键在设置间移动，空格或回车切换，左右键移动滑块，Page Up 和 Page Down 切换分区。窗口打开时，这些按键不做其他事。",
    ["Read aloud now"] = "立即朗读",
    ["Reads what is under the mouse, the quest you are reading, or the last whisper. Give it a key in the game's Key Bindings (AddOns, Fantasy Glass UI), or type /fgui read."] = "朗读鼠标下的内容、你正在读的任务或最后一条密语。可在游戏按键设置（插件，Fantasy Glass UI）中设置按键，或输入 /fgui read。",
    ["Ready checks, whispers, missing buffs and your own alerts said aloud. They are with the other alerts, in Combat."] = "就位确认、密语、缺少的增益和你的自定义提示会被朗读。它们和其他提示一起，在“战斗”中。",
    ["Copy my accessibility settings"] = "复制我的辅助功能设置",
    ["All of these settings in one line of text, to keep or give to someone."] = "把这些设置变成一行文字，留存或分享。",
    ["Paste accessibility settings"] = "粘贴辅助功能设置",
    ["Takes a line someone gave you and sets everything in it at once."] = "读取别人给你的一行文字，一次设置好其中所有内容。",
    ["Captions for sounds"] = "声音字幕",
    ["Captions"] = "字幕",
    ["A line on screen for whatever gets your attention with a sound: a ready check, a whisper, a queue that is ready, a group invite, a duel, a boss emote, a raid warning, a roll on loot, the aggro warning and your own alerts. Each has a mark for its kind. For playing with the sound off, or for anyone who cannot hear it."] = "为所有用声音提醒你的事在屏幕上显示一行字：就位确认、密语、排队就绪、组队邀请、决斗、首领表情、团队警告、拾取掷骰、仇恨警告和你的自定义提示。每种都有自己的标记。适合关闭声音游戏，或听不到声音的玩家。",
    ["Ready check from %s"] = "%s 发起了就位确认",
    ["Group invite from %s"] = "%s 邀请你组队",
    ["Duel request from %s"] = "%s 向你发起决斗",
    ["Your group is ready: accept to join"] = "你的队伍已就绪：接受即可加入",
    ["%s is ready: enter now"] = "%s 已就绪：立即进入",
    ["Battleground"] = "战场",
    ["Raid warning: %s"] = "团队警告：%s",
    ["Roll on loot"] = "拾取掷骰",
    ["%s offers to resurrect you"] = "%s 愿意复活你",
    ["You are being summoned"] = "有人在召唤你",
    ["A monster is attacking you"] = "有怪物在攻击你",
    ["Nothing to read: point at something with a tooltip, open a quest, or wait for a whisper."] = "没有可朗读的：指向有提示的东西、打开任务，或等待密语。",
    ["This game client cannot read aloud (%s)."] = "此游戏客户端无法朗读（%s）。",
    ["no text-to-speech"] = "没有文字转语音",
    ["this game client cannot speak"] = "此游戏客户端无法发声",
    ["the game refused to speak"] = "游戏拒绝发声",
    ["That is not a line of accessibility settings."] = "这不是一行辅助功能设置。",
    ["That line holds no settings."] = "这一行没有任何设置。",
    ["%d accessibility setting taken. Some take effect after a /reload."] = "已采用 %d 项辅助功能设置。部分需 /reload 后生效。",
    ["%d accessibility settings taken. Some take effect after a /reload."] = "已采用 %d 项辅助功能设置。部分需 /reload 后生效。",
    ["Paste a line of accessibility settings (Ctrl+V), then press Use them."] = "粘贴一行辅助功能设置（Ctrl+V），然后点“使用”。",
    ["Use them"] = "使用",
    ["Your accessibility settings in one line: Ctrl+C to copy. /fgui access paste takes one back."] = "你的辅助功能设置，一行文字：Ctrl+C 复制。/fgui access paste 可导入。",
    ["Read aloud (tooltip, quest or last whisper)"] = "朗读（提示、任务或最后一条密语）",
    ["Comfort"] = "舒适",
    ["Anything that makes the game easier to see, hear or follow. All of it can be changed later in /fgui, under Accessibility."] = "一切让游戏更容易看、听、跟上的设置。之后都能在 /fgui 的“辅助功能”中更改。",
    ["More"] = "更多",
    ["Paste shared settings"] = "粘贴分享的设置",
    ["Someone gave you a line of accessibility settings? Paste it here and they are all set at once."] = "有人给了你一行辅助功能设置？粘贴到这里，一次全部设置好。",
    ["the accessibility settings (/fgui access copy: all of them in one line to share; paste: take one)"] = "辅助功能设置（/fgui access copy：全部变成一行以分享；paste：导入一行）",
    ["read aloud what is under the mouse, the quest you are reading, or the last whisper (tooltip, quest, whisper)"] = "朗读鼠标下的内容、正在读的任务或最后一条密语（tooltip、quest、whisper）",
    ["A new settings window: the categories down the left, Home with a card for each, and every setting on a line of its own that says what it does. The search tells you where each setting lives, and Undo takes back your last change."] = "全新的设置窗口：左侧是类别，首页每个类别一张卡片，每项设置单独一行并说明用途。搜索会告诉你每项设置在哪里，撤销可还原你的上次更改。",
    ["Simple or All options, at the top: the settings most players look for, or every one. The search always finds them all."] = "顶部的“简洁”或“全部选项”：大多数玩家要找的设置，或全部设置。搜索总能找到所有设置。",
    ["A new setup in four steps: how you play (your role and what you enjoy), your look, and what you chose. It can also keep the game's own frames and only restyle them."] = "全新的四步设置：你的玩法（职责和喜好）、外观，以及你的选择。也可以保留游戏自带的框体，只换外观。",
    ["Accessibility, in one place: color-blind safe colors with dots for item quality, reduce motion, a second high-contrast theme (Fantasy) and three text sizes."] = "辅助功能集中在一处：适合色盲的颜色（物品品质用圆点标出）、减少动效、第二套高对比度主题（奇幻）和三种文字大小。",
    ["Settings from before profiles (versions before 9.0) are no longer read: they start afresh, and the setup opens."] = "配置功能之前（9.0 以前版本）的设置不再读取：将重新开始，并打开设置向导。",
    ["Frames and bars: each action bar's size, opacity, when it shows, rows and spacing"] = "框体与动作条：每条动作条的大小、不透明度、显示时机、行数和间距",
    ["Bar size is set for all bars together, in Frames and bars › Action bars."] = "动作条大小在“框体与动作条 › 动作条”中统一设置。",
    ["|cffffff00/fgui setup|r goes through it yourself; Layout and profiles › Profiles shares another profile instead."] = "|cffffff00/fgui setup|r 自己逐步设置；或在“布局与配置 › 配置”中共用另一个配置。",
    ["off (switch on \"Bags: use items in combat\" in Bags and items › Bags and bank to try it)"] = "关（在“背包与物品 › 背包与银行”中开启“Bags: use items in combat”试试）",
    ["Sized in Frames and bars › Action bars."] = "大小在“框体与动作条 › 动作条”中设置。",
    ["Click a line to open it. /fgui briefing shows this again; Quests and map › Progress can turn it off."] = "点击一行打开。/fgui briefing 可再次显示；可在“任务与地图 › 进度”中关闭。",
    ["no abilities chosen (Combat › Cooldowns)"] = "未选择技能（战斗 › 冷却）",
    ["Saved as the profile \"%s\": choose it in Layout and profiles › Profiles."] = "已保存为配置“%s”：在“布局与配置 › 配置”中选择它。",
    ["Nothing to send: switch on a material in Bags and items › Mail and say who it goes to."] = "没有可发送的：在“背包与物品 › 邮件”中开启一种材料并填写收件人。",
    ["the settings at Tools: every window, and things to do once"] = "设置中的工具：所有窗口和一次性操作",
    ["The threat meter is switched off (Combat › Damage and threat)."] = "仇恨统计已关闭（战斗 › 伤害与仇恨）。",
    ["Quest guides are unlocked on this account. They are under Guide in /fgui."] = "此账号已解锁任务指南。它们在 /fgui 的“指南”中。",
    ["They are switched off: see \"Invite by whisper\" in Chat and people › Whispers and invites."] = "已关闭：见“聊天与玩家 › 密语与邀请”中的“Invite by whisper”。",
    ["The damage meter is not a drawer right now (see \"Damage meter: drawer on the chat box\" in Combat › Damage and threat)."] = "伤害统计目前不是抽屉（见“战斗 › 伤害与仇恨”中的“Damage meter: drawer on the chat box”）。",
    ["It is switched off: see \"Vendors: restock list\" in Bags and items › Vendors."] = "已关闭：见“背包与物品 › 商人”中的“Vendors: restock list”。",
    ["The loot log is switched off (Bags and items › Bags and bank)."] = "拾取记录已关闭（背包与物品 › 背包与银行）。",
    ["Farming sessions are switched off (Bags and items › Gold and farming)."] = "刷取记录已关闭（背包与物品 › 金币与刷取）。",
    ["Switched off in the settings, so not shown: %s."] = "设置中已关闭，因此不显示：%s。",
    ["Quest guides are switched off. Switch them on under Guide in /fgui, or in the setup."] = "任务指南已关闭。可在 /fgui 的“指南”中或设置向导中开启。",
    ["Bags, friends, guild and mail also need their switch on in the settings."] = "背包、好友、公会和邮件还需要在设置中开启各自的开关。",
    ["Type /fgui for the settings: every feature by category, themes under Look and themes, and a search that finds any setting."] = "输入 /fgui 打开设置：按类别排列的所有功能、“外观与主题”中的主题，以及能找到任何设置的搜索。",
    ["Not sure where something is? On the Home page of /fgui, ask the guide in plain words, such as how do I make the bars bigger, and it shows you."] = "不知道某项在哪里？在 /fgui 首页用简单的话问指南，比如怎么把动作条变大，它会指给你看。",
    ["It is switched off: see \"Smaller world map\" in Quests and map › World map and travel."] = "已关闭：见“任务与地图 › 世界地图与旅行”中的“Smaller world map”。",
    ["Sized in Frames and bars › Your frames (Class resource)."] = "大小在“框体与动作条 › 你的框体”（职业资源）中设置。",
    ["That is a whole profile, not a layout. Import it in Layout and profiles › Profiles."] = "这是整个配置，不是布局。请在“布局与配置 › 配置”中导入。",
    ["It is switched off: see \"Execute line on the target\" in Combat › Alerts and warnings."] = "已关闭：见“战斗 › 提示与警告”中的“Execute line on the target”。",
    ["No add-on here has brought LibSharedMedia, so there are only our own fonts and textures (Look and themes › Accent and lettering)."] = "这里没有插件提供 LibSharedMedia，因此只有我们自己的字体和材质（外观与主题 › 强调色与字体）。",
    ["The action bars are not being looked after by this add-on: either \"Action bars\" is switched off, above, or another add-on has the bars."] = "动作条未由本插件管理：要么上方的“Action bars”已关闭，要么其他插件接管了动作条。",
    ["Frames and bars › Party, boss and arena"] = "框体与动作条 › 小队、首领和竞技场",
    ["Tank, Healer and Damage in Layout and profiles › Profiles"] = "“布局与配置 › 配置”中的坦克、治疗和输出",
    ["a picture on each theme button in Look and themes › Themes"] = "“外观与主题 › 主题”中每个主题按钮上的图片",
    ["The AFK screen is switched off, above, so these do nothing yet."] = "上方的离开画面已关闭，因此这些暂时不起作用。",
    ["Size uses the game's own nameplate scale and waits until you are out of combat. Cast bars and debuff icons need \"Nameplate casts & debuffs\" on, above; names and highlighting apply to plates as they appear."] = "大小使用游戏自身的姓名板缩放，并等待脱离战斗。施法条和减益图标需要开启上方的“Nameplate casts & debuffs”；名字和高亮会在姓名板出现时生效。",
    ["Debuffs on nameplates need \"Nameplate casts & debuffs\" on, in Frames and bars › Nameplates."] = "姓名板上的减益需要在“框体与动作条 › 姓名板”中开启“Nameplate casts & debuffs”。",
    ["Switch on \"Class resource\", above, to see it. Move it with move mode."] = "开启上方的“Class resource”即可看到。用移动模式移动它。",
    ["Bags: my own rules"] = "背包：我自己的规则",
    ["Mail: my own rules"] = "邮件：我自己的规则",
    ["A row of abilities you choose, each showing its cooldown. Choose them below."] = "一排你选的技能，各自显示冷却。在下方选择。",
    ["A large icon when a buff you chose is on you. Choose them below."] = "当你选的增益在身上时显示一个大图标。在下方选择。",
    ["Shows health on each nameplate's bar: a percentage, or the amount if \"Health as numbers, not %\" is switched on, beside it."] = "在每个姓名板上显示生命：百分比，或在旁边开启“Health as numbers, not %”时显示数值。",
    ["Drag the character window, spellbook, vendor, mailbox and the game's other windows by any empty part of them; each opens where you left it. \"Reset window positions\" in Layout and profiles puts them all back. Protected windows cannot be moved during combat."] = "可拖动角色窗口、法术书、商人、邮箱等游戏窗口的任意空白处；每个窗口都会在你放下的位置打开。“布局与配置”中的“Reset window positions”可全部复位。受保护的窗口在战斗中无法移动。",
    ["Alerts you make yourself, below: when your health or mana is low, a buff is missing, an ability is ready, your target casts, your bags are nearly full... show a line, play a sound, or say it."] = "你在下方自己制作的提示：生命或法力低、缺少增益、技能就绪、目标施法、背包快满……显示一行字、播放声音或朗读。",
    ["Says things aloud with the game's own text-to-speech voice: ready checks, whispers, missing buffs, loss of control and your custom alerts. Choose which below."] = "用游戏自带的语音朗读：就位确认、密语、缺少的增益、失控和你的自定义提示。在下方选择哪些。",
    ["Our own action bars in place of the game's: eight bars of real action buttons, each with its own number of buttons, rows, size, spacing and direction, set at once below without the game's Edit Mode. Bar 1 changes page with your stance, form or stealth. Your key bindings press them. Needs Action bars on, and a /reload."] = "用我们自己的动作条代替游戏的：八条真正的动作按钮，每条有自己的按钮数、行数、大小、间距和方向，无需游戏的编辑模式，在下方即时设置。第 1 条会随姿态、形态或潜行翻页。你的按键绑定可按下它们。需要开启 Action bars 并 /reload。",
    ["Switches to the theme you chose for cities and inns, dungeons, raids or everywhere else, as you travel. Choose them below. Only between themes of the same family."] = "旅行时切换到你为城市和旅店、地下城、团队副本或其他地方选的主题。在下方选择。仅在同系列主题之间切换。",
    ["When an ability on the cooldown tracker comes off cooldown, its icon appears in the middle of the screen for a moment. Choose the abilities below; place the pulse in move mode."] = "冷却追踪中的技能冷却结束时，其图标会在屏幕中央出现片刻。在下方选择技能；在移动模式中摆放位置。",
    ["The sections you make yourself with the bag rules below (or /fgui bagrules). They come first: the first rule an item meets decides its section."] = "用下方背包规则（或 /fgui bagrules）自己做的分区。它们优先：物品首先符合的规则决定其分区。",
    ["Your own mail rules, below (or /fgui mailrules), are sent too."] = "下方你自己的邮件规则（或 /fgui mailrules）也会发送。",
    ["Your combo points, holy power, soul shards, chi, arcane charges, essence or runes, shown the way you design it below (Class resource): dots, a bar or a number, any size, anywhere."] = "你的连击点、神圣能量、灵魂碎片、真气、奥术充能、精华或符文，按你在下方（职业资源）设计的样子显示：圆点、条或数字，任意大小，任意位置。",
    ["Sets the whole interface to the scale where one of its pixels is one of your screen's, so thin rims and lettering stay sharp. Switching it off puts back the scale the game had. Interface size, in Look and themes › Accessibility, still works on top of it."] = "把整个界面设为其一个像素等于屏幕一个像素的缩放，让细边框和文字保持清晰。关闭后恢复游戏原有缩放。“外观与主题 › 辅助功能”中的界面大小仍可叠加使用。",
    ["Your choices use %d feature. Every switch is in /fgui, by category."] = "你的选择使用 %d 项功能。所有开关都在 /fgui 中按类别排列。",
    ["Your choices use %d features. Every switch is in /fgui, by category."] = "你的选择使用 %d 项功能。所有开关都在 /fgui 中按类别排列。",
    ["Choose glass, fantasy or celestial, then a theme. The accent is the highlight color. Everything applies as you click; the lettering style and much more are under Look and themes in /fgui."] = "选择玻璃、奇幻或星辰，再选一个主题。强调色是高亮颜色。点击即生效；字体样式等更多内容在 /fgui 的“外观与主题”中。",
    ["Windows fade in as they open, and alerts pop up instead of appearing."] = "窗口打开时淡入，提示弹出而不是直接出现。",
    ["Your frame flashes for a moment on a critical hit or heal."] = "暴击或治疗暴击时，你的框体会闪一下。",
    ["Your own frame fades out while you are at full health and out of combat."] = "满血且不在战斗中时，你自己的框体会淡出。",
    ["The weapon imbue reminder shows only while you fight."] = "武器附魔提醒只在战斗中显示。",
    ["The quest tracker and the info bar fade back while you fight."] = "战斗时任务追踪和信息条会淡出。",
    ["Tooltips sit by the mouse pointer instead of in the corner."] = "鼠标提示显示在指针旁，而不是角落。",
    ["The class emblems on portraits shimmer gently."] = "头像上的职业徽记会轻轻闪烁。",
    ["The size of every action bar. Each bar can be sized again on its own, below."] = "所有动作条的大小。下方还可以单独调整每一条。",
    ["How solid windows are: bags, these settings, lists."] = "窗口的不透明度：背包、本设置窗口、列表。",
    ["Where the execute line sits on the target's health bar."] = "斩杀线在目标生命条上的位置。",
    ["How big the smaller world map is."] = "缩小版世界地图的大小。",
    ["The game's master volume, without opening its sound settings."] = "游戏主音量，无需打开游戏的声音设置。",
    ["Click for the next order: by group, by role, or by name."] = "点击切换排序：按小队、按职责或按名字。",
    ["A font another add-on brings (LibSharedMedia). Click to step through them, right-click to step back. /reload shows it everywhere."] = "其他插件提供的字体（LibSharedMedia）。点击切换，右键返回。/reload 后处处生效。",
    ["A bar texture another add-on brings (LibSharedMedia). Click to step through them, right-click to step back."] = "其他插件提供的条形材质（LibSharedMedia）。点击切换，右键返回。",
    ["Choose what the info bar shows, and in what order."] = "选择信息条显示什么，以及顺序。",
    ["Look and themes"] = "外观与主题",
    ["Themes, accent, lettering, sounds and accessibility."] = "主题、强调色、字体、声音和辅助功能。",
