    ["Gold and farming"] = "金币与刷取",
    ["Quests and map"] = "任务与地图",
    ["Quests, the minimap, the info bar, the world map and your progress."] = "任务、小地图、信息条、世界地图和你的进度。",
    ["World map and travel"] = "世界地图与旅行",
    ["Chat, whispers, what tooltips say about players, and the people you meet."] = "聊天、密语、鼠标提示中的玩家信息，以及你遇到的人。",
    ["Whispers and invites"] = "密语与邀请",
    ["Player tooltips"] = "玩家提示",
    ["People"] = "玩家",
    ["Small jobs done by themselves, and the game's own settings set for you."] = "自动完成的小事，以及替你设置好的游戏选项。",
    ["Layout and profiles"] = "布局与配置",
    ["Move and size panels, profiles, sharing and backups."] = "移动和缩放面板、配置、分享和备份。",
    ["Moving and scale"] = "移动与缩放",
    ["Windows to open and things to do once."] = "可打开的窗口和一次性操作。",
    ["Quest guides."] = "任务指南。",
    ["Every switch and slider of this category goes back to how Fantasy Glass UI comes. Your lists, rules, designs and positions are kept."] = "本类别的所有开关和滑块恢复为 Fantasy Glass UI 的初始状态。你的列表、规则、设计和位置会保留。",
    ["Showing sample frames"] = "正在显示示例框体",
    ["after /reload"] = "/reload 后",
    ["Reset %s to how it came"] = "将%s恢复初始",
    ["Hide sample frames"] = "隐藏示例框体",
    ["Made-up party, raid and boss frames, bars and alerts, so you can see what you change. Click again to put them away."] = "虚构的小队、团队和首领框体、条和提示，让你看到改动效果。再次点击收起。",
    ["how it came"] = "初始状态",
    ["The profile these settings are saved in"] = "这些设置所保存的配置",
    ["Click to change profile, or make a new one."] = "点击切换配置或新建一个。",
    ["Undo: %s"] = "撤销：%s",
    ["Back to %s."] = "恢复为%s。",
    ["Undo last change"] = "撤销上次更改",
    ["Nothing changed yet. Each change you make here can be taken back, one at a time."] = "尚无更改。在这里做的每个更改都可以逐一撤销。",
    ["in All options"] = "在“全部选项”中",
    ["What would you like to change?"] = "你想更改什么？",
    ["Click twice. Auto quest and the look options are left as they are."] = "点击两次。自动任务和外观选项保持不变。",
    ["Pick a place below or in the list, or search. %s theme · %d of %d features on."] = "在下方或列表中选择，或搜索。%s 主题 · 已开启 %d/%d 项功能。",
    ["Nothing changed yet. Changes you make show here, and Undo takes them back."] = "尚无更改。你的更改会显示在这里，撤销可以还原。",
    ["All options"] = "全部选项",
    ["Simple"] = "简洁",
    ["Home"] = "首页",
    ["NEW"] = "新",
    ["Search every option"] = "搜索所有选项",
    ["The options most players look for. The search still finds every one."] = "大多数玩家要找的选项。搜索仍能找到全部。",
    ["Every option there is."] = "所有选项。",
    ["Opens the first-run setup: how you play, your look, your layout. It starts from your current choices and changes nothing until you click."] = "打开首次设置：你的玩法、外观、布局。从当前选择开始，点击前不会更改任何内容。",
    ["Drag to resize"] = "拖动调整大小",
    ["Drag the corner to make the window bigger or smaller. The size is kept."] = "拖动角落放大或缩小窗口。大小会被记住。",
    ["Quick switches"] = "快捷开关",
    ["Changed lately"] = "最近更改",
    ["It is switched off. Its switch is in %s."] = "已关闭。开关位于%s。",
    ["the settings"] = "设置",
    ["Saved. Turn on the cooldown tracker and reload to see it."] = "已保存。开启冷却追踪并重载即可看到。",
    ["Turn on the cooldown tracker and reload to see it."] = "开启冷却追踪并重载即可看到。",
    ["Puts the game's windows you have dragged back where the game puts them."] = "把你拖动过的游戏窗口放回游戏默认的位置。",
    ["Any size from 70 to 150: /fgui textsize."] = "70 到 150 之间任意大小：/fgui textsize。",
    ["%d change needs a reload"] = "%d 项更改需要重载",
    ["%d changes need a reload"] = "%d 项更改需要重载",
    ["%d of %d on"] = "已开 %d/%d",
    ["Layout and profiles › Moving and scale has a scale slider for every panel. Unit frames, raid frames and action bars are sized with each of them, in Frames and bars. In move mode, right-click a panel for its own scale."] = "布局与配置 › 移动与缩放为每个面板提供缩放滑块。单位框体、团队框体和动作条在“框体与动作条”中各自调整。移动模式下右键面板可单独缩放。",
    ["Look and themes › Themes lists every theme under Glass, Fantasy and Celestial; click one to see it at once. Your own theme, beside it, makes one from three colors."] = "外观与主题 › 主题列出玻璃、奇幻和星辰下的所有主题，点击即可立即查看。旁边的“你自己的主题”可用三种颜色制作主题。",
    ["Lettering is chosen in Look and themes › Accent and lettering, separately from the theme. Fonts from other add-ons can be picked there too."] = "字体在“外观与主题 › 强调色与字体”中选择，与主题分开。其他插件的字体也可在那里选择。",
    ["Look and themes › Accessibility has three text sizes; /fgui textsize 130 sets any size from 70 to 150."] = "外观与主题 › 辅助功能提供三种文字大小；/fgui textsize 130 可设定 70 到 150 之间任意大小。",
    ["The swatches in Look and themes › Accent and lettering change the accent color."] = "“外观与主题 › 强调色与字体”中的色块可更改强调色。",
    ["Layout and profiles › Profiles keeps separate sets of settings, copies one to another, and exports them as text to share."] = "布局与配置 › 配置可保存多套设置、互相复制，并导出为文本分享。",
    ["In Frames and bars › Raid frames, bind a mouse button (with or without a modifier) to a spell. Clicking any unit frame then casts it on that player."] = "在“框体与动作条 › 团队框体”中，把鼠标键（可加修饰键）绑定到法术。点击任一单位框体即对该玩家施放。",
    ["Combat › Cooldowns holds the abilities for the cooldown tracker, and Combat › Alerts and warnings the buffs for buff alerts."] = "“战斗 › 冷却”保存冷却追踪的技能，“战斗 › 提示与警告”保存增益提示的增益。",
    ["Every feature has a switch in its section of the settings. Point at one to read what it does; most need a /reload."] = "每项功能在设置的对应分区里都有开关。指向它可阅读说明；大多需要 /reload。",
    ["Frames and bars › Your frames has four choices for portraits: 3D model, 2D picture, class emblem, or none."] = "“框体与动作条 › 你的框体”有四种头像：3D 模型、2D 图片、职业徽记或无。",
    ["In Look and themes › Class colors, pick a class and set its color with the sliders or the color wheel. /fgui colors opens it."] = "在“外观与主题 › 职业颜色”中选一个职业，用滑块或色轮设置颜色。/fgui colors 可打开。",
    ["Battleground help, enemy cooldowns, arena frames, queue alerts."] = "战场助手、敌方冷却、竞技场框体、排队提醒。",
    ["Boss guides and timers, what drops, whose upgrade, your best run times."] = "首领指南与计时、掉落、谁的提升、你的最佳用时。",
    ["Casual and social"] = "休闲与社交",
    ["Collecting and crafting"] = "收藏与制造",
    ["Dungeons and raids"] = "地下城与团队副本",
    ["Each choice switches on the features made for it; hover one to see which. Taking a choice back puts them as they were."] = "每个选择都会开启为它准备的功能；悬停可查看是哪些。取消选择会恢复原样。",
    ["Every feature on, those that pop up or act on their own included."] = "开启全部功能，包括会弹出或自动执行的功能。",
    ["Here is what you chose. Use Back to change anything, then put your frames where you want them."] = "这是你的选择。点“返回”可修改，然后把框体放到你想要的位置。",
    ["How do you play?"] = "你怎么玩？",
    ["How much"] = "范围",
    ["How you play"] = "你的玩法",
    ["Just restyle the game's own"] = "只美化游戏自带界面",
    ["Pick none at all if you like: the features you have stay as they are."] = "也可以什么都不选：你现有的功能保持不变。",
    ["Quest marks on mobs, rewards in the tracker, upgrades shown as you loot."] = "怪物上的任务标记、追踪器里的奖励、拾取时显示提升。",
    ["Questing and leveling"] = "任务与升级",
    ["Ready"] = "就绪",
    ["The game's own unit frames, bags and quest tracker stay; the windows, tooltips, chat, minimap and action bars get the look."] = "保留游戏自带的单位框体、背包和任务追踪；窗口、提示、聊天、小地图和动作条换上新外观。",
    ["The whole interface"] = "整个界面",
    ["Three quick questions, about a minute. Every choice applies as you click, and all of it can be changed later in /fgui."] = "三个简单问题，大约一分钟。点击即生效，之后都可以在 /fgui 里修改。",
    ["What do you enjoy? (pick any)"] = "你喜欢什么？（可多选）",
    ["What your characters own, profession help, auction prices, farming."] = "你的角色拥有什么、专业技能帮助、拍卖价格、刷取。",
    ["You enjoy"] = "你喜欢",
    ["Your look"] = "你的外观",
    ["No role"] = "不选职责",
    ["Switches on:"] = "开启：",
    ["Fine-tune in all settings"] = "在全部设置中微调",
    ["Your switches are your own mix, so none of the three is marked. The next step adds to them."] = "你的开关是自己的组合，所以三项都没有标记。下一步会在此基础上添加。",
    ["if something looks wrong"] = "如果有东西不对劲",
    ["your own mix"] = "你自己的组合",
    ["Fantasy Glass UI's own frames, bars, bags, minimap, quest tracker and windows, with its helpers. Recommended."] = "Fantasy Glass UI 自己的框体、动作条、背包、小地图、任务追踪和窗口，以及各种助手。推荐。",
    ["A better chat, a whisper window, notes on players, guild notices."] = "更好的聊天、私聊窗口、玩家备注、公会通知。",
    ["PvP"] = "PvP",
    ["Accessibility"] = "辅助功能",
    ["High contrast"] = "高对比度",
    ["Fantasy: High contrast"] = "奇幻：高对比度",
    ["Any size from 70 to 150: the Layout tab, or /fgui textsize."] = "70 到 150 之间的任意大小：布局标签页，或 /fgui textsize。",
    ["Good and bad are shown in blue and orange instead of green and red, debuffs get a letter, and item quality gets dots: one for uncommon, two for rare, three for epic, four for legendary."] = "好与坏以蓝色和橙色代替绿色和红色显示，减益效果带字母，物品品质带圆点：优秀一个、精良两个、史诗三个、传说四个。",
    ["Show all options"] = "显示全部选项",
    ["Off: the options most players look for. On: every option, on every tab. The search at the top always looks through all of them."] = "关：大多数玩家常用的选项。开：每个标签页的全部选项。顶部的搜索始终搜索全部选项。",
    ["Your settings were from a version too old for 12.0, so they start afresh. The setup opens to help."] = "你的设置来自对 12.0 来说过旧的版本，因此将重新开始。设置向导会打开来帮助你。",
    ["\"%s\" is not a command. Did you mean |cffffff00/fgui %s|r?"] = "“%s”不是命令。你是想输入 |cffffff00/fgui %s|r 吗？",
    ["\"%s\" is not a command. These mention it:"] = "“%s”不是命令。以下命令提到了它：",
    ["\"%s\" is not a command. |cffffff00/fgui help|r lists them all."] = "“%s”不是命令。|cffffff00/fgui help|r 会列出全部命令。",
