    ["Choose glass, fantasy or celestial, then a theme. The accent is the highlight color. Everything applies as you click, and all of it can be changed later on the Look tab of /fgui."] = "先选玻璃、奇幻或星空，再选一个主题。强调色是高亮颜色。点击即生效，之后都可以在 /fgui 的“外观”页更改。",
