    ["Click a guide to follow it. Right-click to read, change, copy or delete it."] = "点击指南开始跟随。右键阅读、修改、复制或删除。",
    ["Click a name to whisper."] = "点击名字发送密语。",
    ["Click a name to whisper. Right-click to invite."] = "点击名字密语。右键邀请。",
    ["Click a unit frame to cast on that player. Works on party and the other Fantasy Glass UI unit frames; raid frames here are the game's own, which have their own click-casting in the game's options. Type the spell's name exactly as in your spellbook. A plain left or right click replaces \"target\" or the right-click menu, so a modifier is usually the better choice."] = "点击单位框体即可对该玩家施法。适用于小队和其他 Fantasy Glass UI 单位框体；这里的团队框体是游戏自带的，在游戏选项中有自己的点击施法。请按法术书中的名字准确输入法术名。不带修饰键的左键或右键点击会取代\"选为目标\"或右键菜单，因此通常最好加修饰键。",
    ["Click a unit frame to cast on that player. Works on raid, party and all other Fantasy Glass UI unit frames. Type the spell's name exactly as in your spellbook. A plain left or right click replaces \"target\" or the right-click menu on those frames, so a modifier is usually the better choice."] = "点击单位框体即可对该玩家施法。适用于团队、小队以及所有其他 Fantasy Glass UI 单位框体。请按法术书中的名字准确输入法术名。不带修饰键的左键或右键点击会取代这些框体上的\"选为目标\"或右键菜单，因此通常最好加修饰键。",
    ["Click casting"] = "点击施法",
    ["Click for a waypoint (in that zone)."] = "点击设置路径点（在该区域）。",
    ["Click for the next choice; right-click to step back."] = "点击下一个选项；右键返回上一个。",
    ["Click in the report below, then press Ctrl+A and Ctrl+C to copy all of it."] = "点击下面的报告，按 Ctrl+A 再按 Ctrl+C 全部复制。",
    ["click in the text, Ctrl+A then Ctrl+C to copy"] = "点击文字，按 Ctrl+A 再按 Ctrl+C 复制",
    ["Click one to put it in the chat box. /fgui help bags shows only the ones about bags."] = "点击一项即可放入聊天框。/fgui help bags 仅显示与背包有关的。",
    ["Click one to put it on, or /fgui set <name>. The first five can have keys (Key Bindings, Fantasy Glass UI)."] = "点击一个即可穿上，或输入 /fgui set <名称>。前五个方案可以设置按键（按键设置，Fantasy Glass UI）。",
    ["Click one to read it. Right-click twice to delete it."] = "点击一项即可阅读。右键点击两次即可删除。",
    ["Click the address above and press Ctrl+C to copy it. Start a new email to that address."] = "点击上面的地址并按 Ctrl+C 复制，然后给这个地址写一封新邮件。",
    ["Click the address above, press Ctrl+C, and paste it into your web browser."] = "点击上面的地址，按 Ctrl+C，然后粘贴到浏览器里。",
    ["Click to bring it out"] = "点击展开",
