    ["Click to cancel this timer"] = "点击取消此计时",
    ["Click to change: always, only in combat, only out of combat, or only while you have a target. While you are moving panels everything shows, so the change is seen once you leave move mode."] = "点击切换：总是、仅战斗中、仅战斗外，或仅有目标时。移动面板时会全部显示，因此离开移动模式后才能看到变化。",
