    ["Click to star it: you will be told when it drops."] = "点击加星标：它掉落时会提醒你。",
    ["Click to step through: always, when pointed at, in combat, out of combat, with a target, never. A bar that is not showing is see-through, and its buttons can still be pressed where they were. Every bar shows while you move panels or hold a spell on the mouse."] = "点击依次切换：总是、鼠标指向时、战斗中、战斗外、有目标时、从不。隐藏的动作条是透明的，按钮仍可在原处按下。移动面板或鼠标上拿着法术时，所有动作条都会显示。",
    ["Click to take it off your wishlist."] = "点击从愿望清单中移除。",
