    ["Drops from %s: in %d of your %d kills."] = "掉落自 %s：你的 %d 次击杀中出现 %d 次。",
    ["Drops the red lines that repeat constantly in a fight: not enough mana or rage, not ready yet, out of range, wrong facing, no target. Everything else the game says there still shows. Presets never change this."] = "去掉战斗中不断重复的红字：法力或怒气不足、尚未就绪、超出范围、朝向错误、没有目标。游戏的其他提示照常显示。预设从不更改此项。",
