    ["Durability below %"] = "耐久度低于 %",
    ["During combat the quest tracker and the info bar dim right down, and return when the fight ends."] = "战斗中任务追踪和信息栏大幅变暗，战斗结束后恢复。",
    ["Dusts, essences and shards are sent to the character typed beside \"Enchanting materials\" below."] = "尘、精华和碎片会发给下方“附魔材料”旁填写的角色。",
    ["each character remembers its own choice"] = "每个角色记住自己的选择",
    ["Each dungeon and raid you go into is a run: how long it took, the bosses killed and when, the wipes on each, your deaths and your rare and better loot. /fgui runs lists them place by place, each with its best time (the quickest of the runs that killed the most bosses). Stepping out to repair is still the same run."] = "你进入的每个地下城和团队副本都是一次记录：用时、击杀的首领及时间、每个首领的团灭次数、你的死亡次数，以及稀有及以上的战利品。/fgui runs 按地点列出，每处都有最佳用时（击杀首领最多的记录中最快的一次）。出去修理装备仍算同一次。",
    ["Each family of themes is built differently, so this change finishes when the setup reloads the interface at the end."] = "每个主题系列的构造不同，此更改将在设置最后重新载入界面时完成。",
    ["Each puts your frames where that interface does. One undo (/fgui undo) takes it back."] = "每项都按那套界面的方式摆放框体。一次撤销（/fgui undo）即可恢复。",
    ["Each tab holds one bag."] = "每个标签放一个背包。",
    ["Each talent set remembers the gear set you last put on while it was active (with the gear set buttons or the game's equipment manager). Switch talent sets and that gear set goes on by itself. Nothing to set up. Presets never change this."] = "每套天赋会记住其生效时你最后换上的装备套装（通过套装按钮或游戏的装备管理器）。切换天赋时自动换上该套装。无需设置。预设从不更改此项。",
