    ["Farming by zone: /fgui farm zones lists your best farming spots by gold an hour, and whether your latest time there was up or down."] = "按区域刷取：/fgui farm zones 按每小时金币列出你的最佳刷取地点，以及最近一次是上升还是下降。",
