    ["Hides the box with a face that speaks during some quests. The voice still plays."] = "隐藏某些任务中说话的头像框。语音仍会播放。",
    ["Hides the game's raid manager, the panel that slides out from the left edge of the screen in a group. The Raid tools panel has ready checks, markers and role polls, and leaving a group is in the game menu or on your portrait. If you use the game's own raid frames, its group filters (which groups to show) go with it."] = "隐藏游戏的团队管理器，即组队时从屏幕左边缘滑出的面板。“团队工具”面板有就位确认、标记和职责确认，退出队伍可通过游戏菜单或你的头像。若使用游戏自带的团队框体，其队伍筛选也会一并隐藏。",
