    ["How Fantasy Glass UI comes: everything except the four that flash, pop up or act on their own - notifications, the aggro warning, the AFK screen and level-up screenshots."] = "Fantasy Glass UI 默认：除四项会闪烁、弹出或自动执行的功能外全部开启——提示、仇恨警告、离开画面和升级截图。",
