    ["In arenas and battlegrounds: an enemy player's PvP trinket, interrupt and dispel, counting down once they have used it. Beside the arena enemy frames, and under your target and focus frames. Only spells the game names to add-ons can be seen."] = "在竞技场和战场中：敌方玩家的 PvP 饰品、打断和驱散，使用后开始倒计时。位于竞技场敌人框体旁，以及你的目标和焦点框体下方。只能看到游戏告知插件的法术。",
    ["In combat"] = "战斗中",
    ["in combat: it changes when the fight ends"] = "战斗中：战斗结束后更改",
    ["In move mode, a panel you drag snaps to the edges of nearby panels as well as to the grid, so things line up. Hold Shift to place freely."] = "移动模式中拖动的面板会吸附到附近面板边缘和网格，使排列整齐。按住 Shift 可自由放置。",
