    ["In the bag window, right-clicking at a vendor sells the item, gear too; at the bank it stores it."] = "在背包窗口中，在商人处右键点击会卖掉物品（包括装备）；在银行则存入。",
    ["In the Click casting section of the Combat tab, bind a mouse button (with or without a modifier) to a spell. Clicking any unit frame then casts it on that player."] = "在“战斗”页的点击施法中，把鼠标按键（可带修饰键）绑定到法术，点击任意单位框体就会对该玩家施放。",
    ["In the Portraits and class colors section of the Look tab there are four choices for portraits: 3D model, 2D picture, class emblem, or none."] = "“外观”页的“头像与职业颜色”中有四种头像：3D 模型、2D 图片、职业徽记或无。",
    ["In the Portraits and class colors section of the Look tab, pick a class and set its color with the sliders or the color wheel. /fgui colors opens it."] = "在“外观”页的“头像与职业颜色”中选择职业，用滑块或色轮设定颜色。/fgui colors 可直接打开。",
