    ["Notes each character's week as you play it: gold made or spent, time played, levels, raids and dungeons, best loot. /fgui recap shows the last week; the login briefing says when a new one is ready."] = "记录每个角色在你游玩时的一周：赚到或花掉的金币、游戏时间、等级、团队副本和地下城、最佳战利品。/fgui recap 显示上一周；有新回顾时登录简报会提示。",
