    ["Notes what each boss drops as you kill it in raids and dungeons - from your loot window, the loot rolls and what anyone in your group loots - shared by all your characters. /fgui drops shows it, raid by raid and boss by boss, with the upgrades for you first. On clients with the dungeon journal, its loot lists are there too. Click an item to star it for your wishlist (/fgui wish): you are told when it drops or comes up in a roll."] = "在团队副本和地下城击杀首领时记下它的掉落——来自你的拾取窗口、掷骰以及队友拾取的物品——所有角色共享。/fgui drops 按副本和首领显示，对你有提升的排在前面。在有地下城手册的客户端上，也会列出手册中的掉落。 点击物品即可加入愿望清单（/fgui wish）：它掉落或进入掷骰时会提醒你。",
