    ["Off hand"] = "副手",
    ["Off until you choose it. Lets you use potions and other items from the bag window during a fight. While you are in combat the bag window's arrangement is frozen (icons and counts still update) and it re-sorts when the fight ends. If your client can't support it, it switches itself back off and says so in /fgui check."] = "在你选择前保持关闭。允许在战斗中从背包窗口使用药水等物品。战斗中背包排列冻结（图标和数量仍会更新），战斗结束后重新排序。若客户端不支持，会自动关闭并在 /fgui check 中说明。",
    ["Offer this quest to your group."] = "把此任务分享给你的队伍。",
    ["offline"] = "离线",
