    ["on now"] = "进行中",
    ["On the character window, a red E on a piece with no enchant where one usually goes, and a G where a gem socket is empty."] = "在角色窗口中，本该附魔却没有的装备显示红色 E，宝石孔为空时显示 G。",
    ["On the inspect window, shows the item level of each piece the other player wears and their average, like your own character window."] = "在观察窗口中显示对方每件装备的物品等级和平均值，与你的角色窗口相同。",
    ["On the loot roll frames, the button to press lights up and the reason shows beside the item: Need for an item on your wishlist or an upgrade for you (with by how many item levels), Pass for gear you can't use, Greed for the rest. Nothing is ever rolled for you."] = "在掷骰窗口中，应按的按钮会高亮，原因显示在物品旁：愿望清单物品或对你有提升的物品选需求（显示提升多少级），无法使用的装备选放弃，其余选贪婪。绝不会替你掷骰。",
    ["On the page that opens, upload the file you saved."] = "在打开的页面上传你保存的文件。",
    ["on your own"] = "单独",
    ["on your wishlist"] = "在愿望清单中",
    ["On your wishlist, it dropped: %s"] = "愿望清单中的物品掉落了：%s",
