    ["once-a-day crafts on all your characters, and when each is ready"] = "所有角色的每日一次制造，以及各自何时就绪",
    ["One bar"] = "单条",
    ["One line of text with your profile, layout, theme, bars and rules. Anyone with Fantasy Glass UI can paste it in Preview a shared string."] = "包含你的配置、布局、主题、动作条和规则的一行文本。任何装有 Fantasy Glass UI 的人都可粘贴到“预览共享字符串”中。",
    ["One of the add-on's own bars: set these, then press Apply."] = "插件自己的动作条：设置后点“应用”。",
    ["One of your own themes."] = "你自己的主题之一。",
    ["One record of best times: the boss timer's new-best lines now agree with your run log, which also keeps how long each boss fight took."] = "最佳用时只记一处：首领计时器的新纪录提示现在与副本记录一致，副本记录也会保存每场首领战的时长。",
    ["One step to a line: accept, do or turnin, the quest's number and name; goto, note, level. \"| text\" adds a few words, \"@ map:x,y\" a place. Ctrl+A and Ctrl+C copy a guide; Ctrl+V pastes one."] = "每行一步：accept、do 或 turnin，加任务编号和名称；goto、note、level。\"| 文字\"可加几句话，\"@ map:x,y\"可加地点。Ctrl+A 和 Ctrl+C 复制指南；Ctrl+V 粘贴。",
