    ["Open a mailbox first."] = "请先打开邮箱。",
    ["Open a profession and select a recipe first, then type /fgui queue (or /fgui queue 5 to make five)."] = "先打开专业并选择一个配方，然后输入 /fgui queue（或 /fgui queue 5 制作五个）。",
    ["Open a profession and select a recipe first, then type /fgui shop (or /fgui shop 5 to make five)."] = "先打开专业并选择一个配方，然后输入 /fgui shop（或 /fgui shop 5 制作五个）。",
