    ["Opens the loot window where your mouse pointer is, instead of at the side of the screen. A game setting: switching this off puts back what it was. Presets never change this."] = "在鼠标指针处而不是屏幕侧边打开拾取窗口。属于游戏设置：关闭即恢复原值。预设从不更改此项。",
