    ["Players in each column"] = "每列玩家数",
    ["Point at a boss and its tooltip lists what it drops that is on your wishlist or would be an upgrade for you, with how often you have seen it drop. From the loot browser's book (and the dungeon journal where the game has one)."] = "指向首领时，提示会列出它掉落的愿望清单物品或对你有提升的物品，以及你见过它掉落的次数。来自掉落浏览器的记录（游戏有地下城手册时也会使用）。",
    ["Point at a boss: its tooltip lists what it drops that you want or that would be an upgrade for you."] = "指向首领：提示会列出它掉落的你想要或对你有提升的物品。",
    ["Point at a failed line for the whole error. /fgui check has more."] = "指向失败的行查看完整错误。/fgui check 有更多信息。",
