    ["point at any panel to see which feature made it"] = "指向任意面板，看是哪个功能生成的",
    ["Polish: several upgrades looted at once wait their turn, a notice goes once the item is worn, and a goal already reached says so when you set it."] = "打磨：同时拾取的多件提升装备会依次提示，物品穿上后提示自动消失，设定已达成的目标时会立即说明。",
    ["Polish: the setup's themes show their pictures too, and Runic themes no longer carry their family's name there; the home key works less while you cast."] = "打磨：初始设置中的主题也会显示图片，符文主题不再带有家族名称，回家键在施法时工作更少。",
    ["Polish: tooltips on the option buttons and size sliders, the new tools in the Tools menu and as key bindings, and long list lines shown in full under the mouse."] = "打磨：选项按钮和大小滑块加入提示，新工具加入工具菜单并可绑定按键，过长的列表行在鼠标下完整显示。",
