    ["Put the add-on's list windows back in the middle of the screen. Asks first."] = "将插件的列表窗口放回屏幕中央。会先询问。",
    ["Put the mouse over the window first, then type /fgui tree (or name it: /fgui tree CharacterFrame)."] = "请先把鼠标放在窗口上，然后输入 /fgui tree（或指定名字：/fgui tree CharacterFrame）。",
    ["Put the spells on your action bars into the key list."] = "将动作条上的法术放入按键列表。",
    ["Put this panel back where it started, at its first size. /fgui undo puts it back again."] = "把此面板放回初始位置和大小。/fgui undo 可再撤回。",
    ["put this profile back to how it came (type it twice; a backup is kept)"] = "把此配置恢复为初始状态（需输入两次；会保留备份）",
    ["Puts /fgui way in the typing bar: add two numbers, such as 45 62."] = "在输入栏中填入 /fgui way：再加两个数字，例如 45 62。",
    ["Puts a small coin on every item in the bag window that \"Sell junk\" would sell: gray items and anything on your always-sell list, less your never-sell list."] = "在背包窗口中为“出售垃圾”会卖出的每件物品标上小金币：灰色物品和“总是出售”列表中的物品，排除“从不出售”列表。",
    ["Puts back the last move, nudge, resize or reset. Ctrl+Z does the same while you are moving panels."] = "撤销上一次移动、微调、缩放或重置。移动面板时 Ctrl+Z 也一样。",
    ["Puts player tooltips away while you are fighting, so they don't cover the fight. Hold Shift to see one anyway."] = "战斗时收起玩家提示，免得挡住战斗。按住 Shift 仍可查看。",
