    ["Show"] = "显示",
    ["Show as"] = "显示为",
    ["Show me"] = "带我去",
    ["Show on hover"] = "悬停时显示",
    ["Show on map"] = "在地图上显示",
    ["show or hide the threat meter"] = "显示或隐藏仇恨表",
    ["Show or hide your bag slots, to swap or buy bags."] = "显示或隐藏背包栏位，用于更换或购买背包。",
    ["Show or hide your bank tabs: buy a tab with +, then drop a bag onto it."] = "显示或隐藏银行标签：用 + 购买标签，然后把背包拖到上面。",
    ["Show sample frames"] = "显示示例框体",
    ["Show sample unit, party and raid frames so you can see your changes without a group."] = "显示示例单位、小队和团队框体，无需组队即可查看更改。",
    ["Show the add-on in another language. Takes effect after a reload."] = "以其他语言显示插件。重载后生效。",
    ["Show the game's own bank window as well, for what this one cannot do (such as its tab settings). Click again to hide it."] = "同时显示游戏自带的银行窗口，用于本窗口做不到的事（如标签设置）。再次点击隐藏。",
    ["Show this quest in the quest tracker, or take it off."] = "在任务追踪中显示此任务，或将其移除。",
    ["Show: always"] = "显示：始终",
    ["Show: only in combat"] = "显示：仅战斗中",
    ["Show: only out of combat"] = "显示：仅非战斗",
    ["Show: only with a target"] = "显示：仅有目标时",
    ["Showing a panel only at certain times"] = "仅在特定时候显示面板",
    ["Showing everything. Click to show only upgrades for you."] = "正在显示全部。点击只显示对你有提升的物品。",
    ["Showing upgrades for you. Click to show everything."] = "正在显示对你有提升的物品。点击显示全部。",
    ["Shown"] = "显示",
    ["Shows chat as people typed it, without the game's word filter. A game setting: switching this off puts back what it was. Presets never change this."] = "按原文显示聊天，不经游戏的词语过滤。属于游戏设置：关闭即恢复原值。预设从不更改此项。",
    ["Shows mana, rage, energy or whatever the resource is as a percentage: on every unit frame that has a power bar, and beside the bar on nameplates of units that have a resource."] = "以百分比显示法力、怒气、能量等资源：在所有有能量条的单位框体上，以及有资源单位的姓名板能量条旁。",
    ["Shows nameplates out to 41 yards, the furthest the game allows, so you see enemies before they reach you. It never shortens a longer distance. A game setting: switching this off puts back what it was. Presets never change this."] = "将姓名板显示距离扩展到游戏允许的最远 41 码，让你在敌人靠近前就看到。不会缩短更远的距离。属于游戏设置：关闭即恢复原值。预设从不更改此项。",
    ["Shows only the debuffs you applied on the target frame."] = "目标框体上只显示你施放的减益。",
    ["Shows the data other add-ons publish (through LibDataBroker) in a strip under the info bar."] = "在信息栏下方的条带中显示其他插件（通过 LibDataBroker）发布的数据。",
    ["Shows the speaker's name above each chat bubble."] = "在每个聊天气泡上方显示说话者的名字。",
    ["Shows where you are, and where the mouse is pointing, in the bottom left corner of the world map."] = "在世界地图左下角显示你的位置和鼠标所指位置。",
    ["Silences your character's spoken complaints (\"Not enough mana\", \"I can't do that yet\"). The red text stays. A game setting: switching this off puts back what it was. Presets never change this."] = "关闭角色的语音抱怨（“法力值不足”“我还不能那样做”）。红色文字保留。属于游戏设置：关闭即恢复原值。预设从不更改此项。",
    ["six timers are running already"] = "已有六个计时器在运行",
    ["Size %"] = "大小 %",
    ["Size of panels"] = "面板大小",
    ["Sized with the action bars."] = "大小随动作条调整。",
    ["Sizes can't be changed in combat."] = "战斗中无法更改尺寸。",
    ["Skill-ups"] = "技能提升",
