    ["Skill-ups on the profession window: the recipes that still give skill points, best first, with what each needs."] = "专业技能窗口中的技能提升：仍能提升技能的配方，最好的在前，并列出各自所需。",
    ["Skip cutscenes I have seen"] = "跳过看过的过场动画",
    ["Skips a cutscene you have already seen once. The first time, it plays as normal. Hold Ctrl as one starts to watch it again. Presets never change this."] = "跳过已看过一次的过场动画。第一次正常播放。开始时按住 Ctrl 可重新观看。预设从不更改此项。",
