    ["Standard"] = "标准",
    ["Starcut"] = "星芒切割",
    ["Starcut reaches every bar: your cast bar, the class resource (its dots become small diamonds), raid frames, nameplates, timers, experience and totems."] = "星芒切割覆盖每一条：你的施法条、职业资源（圆点变成小菱形）、团队框体、姓名板、计时条、经验条和图腾。",
    ["Starcut reaches the rest of the screen: action buttons and bag slots are cut like gems, their cooldowns to match, and the minimap can be a diamond (Features tab)."] = "星芒切割覆盖整个屏幕：动作按钮和背包格像宝石一样切割，冷却效果与之匹配，小地图也可以是菱形（功能标签页）。",
    ["Starcut windows and tooltips: their corners cut with a fine rim, and stars on big windows."] = "星芒切割的窗口和提示：切角配细边框，大窗口上有星星。",
    ["Start after idle minutes  (0 = when the game marks you away)"] = "闲置几分钟后开始（0 = 游戏标记你离开时）",
    ["Start from a layout made for your role, look at it with sample frames, then drag anything that isn't where you want it."] = "从为你的职责设计的布局开始，用示例框体查看，然后拖动不在理想位置的元素。",
