    ["Trade goods split by kind: Cloth, Leather, Ore and stone, Herbs, Cooking ingredients, Elemental, Enchanting materials and Gems, each its own section."] = "商品按类别分开：布料、皮革、矿石与石头、草药、烹饪材料、元素、附魔材料和宝石，各占一栏。",
