    ["try each feature added since 11.6 and report what works, to copy and send"] = "试用自 11.6 以来新增的每项功能，并报告哪些可用，可复制发送",
    ["try the spoken alerts' voice"] = "试听语音提醒的声音",
    ["Try the voice"] = "试听语音",
    ["tuck the damage meter drawer away, or bring it out"] = "收起或拉出伤害统计抽屉",
    ["Turn in"] = "交付",
    ["Turn on \"Remember bags & bank\" in /fgui to view storage from anywhere."] = "在 /fgui 中开启\"记住背包与银行\"，即可随时查看存储。",
    ["Turn on the cooldown tracker on the Features tab and reload to see it."] = "在功能页开启冷却追踪并重新载入。",
    ["Turn these on"] = "开启这些",
    ["Turn this feature back on"] = "重新开启此功能",
    ["Turn this feature off"] = "关闭此功能",
    ["Turn your features back on and reload."] = "重新开启你的功能并重载界面。",
    ["Turns down duel requests for you and says in chat who asked. Hold Shift as one arrives to answer it yourself. Presets never change this."] = "自动拒绝决斗请求，并在聊天中显示是谁发起的。请求到达时按住 Shift 可自行处理。预设从不更改此项。",
    ["Turns off background sounds such as wind, birds and crowds. A game setting: switching this off puts back what it was. Presets never change this."] = "关闭风声、鸟鸣和人群等背景音。属于游戏设置：关闭即恢复原值。预设从不更改此项。",
    ["Turns off the game's music; effects, voices and ambience stay. A game setting: switching this off puts back what it was. Presets never change this."] = "关闭游戏音乐；音效、语音和环境音保留。属于游戏设置：关闭即恢复原值。预设从不更改此项。",
    ["Turns off the soft full-screen glow, for sharper edges and a little more speed. A game setting: switching this off puts back what it was. Presets never change this."] = "关闭全屏柔光，使边缘更清晰、速度稍快。属于游戏设置：关闭即恢复原值。预设从不更改此项。",
    ["Turns rain, snow and sandstorms down to nothing, for a clearer view and a steadier frame rate. A game setting: switching this off puts back what it was. Presets never change this."] = "将雨、雪和沙暴降到无，视野更清晰、帧率更稳定。属于游戏设置：关闭即恢复原值。预设从不更改此项。",
    ["Turquoise"] = "绿松石",
    ["Twenty alerts is the most."] = "最多二十个提醒。",
    ["Two key bindings (the game's Key Bindings, under AddOns): one always uses a healthstone or your best healing potion, the other eats and drinks your best food. Kept up to date as your bags change, between fights."] = "两个按键绑定（游戏按键设置的 AddOns 下）：一个总是使用治疗石或最好的治疗药水，另一个吃喝你最好的食物。在战斗间隙根据背包更新。",
    ["Two small buttons you can move anywhere: a random favorite mount (one that suits where you are; click again to get off) and a random favorite pet. Both have key bindings too (Key Bindings, AddOns)."] = "两个可随意摆放的小按钮：随机常用坐骑（适合当前地点；再次点击下坐骑）和随机常用宠物。两者也都有按键绑定（按键设置，AddOns）。",
    ["Type /fgui bind, point at an action button and press the key. The game's own Key Bindings menu has an AddOns section for this add-on's keys (potion, food, mount and the rest)."] = "输入 /fgui bind，指向动作按钮后按键。游戏的按键设置菜单里有本插件按键的“插件”分类（药水、食物、坐骑等）。",
    ["Type /fgui move, drag anything to where you want it, and type /fgui move again to lock. While moving, right-click a panel for its own scale, nudge, centre and reset."] = "输入 /fgui move，把东西拖到想要的位置，再输入 /fgui move 锁定。移动时右键面板可调整缩放、微调、居中和重置。",
    ["Type /fgui whatsthis (or set a key for it) and point at any panel: it tells you which feature made it, and takes you to its switch."] = "输入 /fgui whatsthis（或为其绑定按键）后指向任意面板：会告诉你是哪个功能生成的，并带你到它的开关。",
    ["Type a name for the theme first (letters and numbers)."] = "请先输入主题名称（字母和数字）。",
    ["Type a question and press Enter. The guide looks through every feature and command of this add-on; it knows nothing else."] = "输入问题并按回车。指南会查找本插件的所有功能和命令，其他内容它不知道。",
    ["Type DELETE for me"] = "帮我输入 DELETE",
    ["Type it for me"] = "帮我输入",
    ["Type who to send it to first."] = "请先输入发送对象。",
    ["Type /reload to finish."] = "输入 /reload 以完成。",
    ["Under your frame: your class's second resource (holy power, soul shards, chi and so on), rune cooldowns, your mana while in a form, and a hunter's pet happiness. Only what your class and this game have is shown."] = "在你的框体下方：职业的第二资源（神圣能量、灵魂碎片、真气等）、符文冷却、变形时的法力，以及猎人宠物的快乐度。只显示你的职业和本游戏具备的。",
