    ["Unit frames, bags and quests"] = "单位框体、背包和任务",
    ["Unlock every panel so you can drag it where you want. Right-click a panel for its size; click again to lock."] = "解锁所有面板以便拖动到任意位置。右键点击面板调整大小；再次点击即可锁定。",
