    ["Welcome"] = "欢迎",
    ["Welcome back"] = "欢迎回来",
    ["Welcome back, %s"] = "欢迎回来，%s",
    ["Welcome to Fantasy Glass UI"] = "欢迎使用 Fantasy Glass UI",
    ["Western European letters only; other languages use the game's fonts."] = "仅含西欧字母；其他语言使用游戏字体。",
    ["what all your characters can craft; search their recipes"] = "你所有角色能制造什么；搜索他们的配方",
    ["what changed in this version"] = "此版本的更改内容",
    ["What do you play?"] = "你玩什么？",
    ["What each boss dropped while you were there. Upgrades for you come first; click an item to star it."] = "你在场时每个首领掉落的物品。对你有提升的排在前面。点击物品可加星标。",
    ["What each feature costs at login"] = "每个功能在登录时的开销",
    ["What happened"] = "发生了什么",
    ["what hit you before you last died"] = "你上次死亡前受到的攻击",
    ["What hit you before you last died."] = "你上次死亡前受到的伤害。",
    ["what in your bags is worth more at the auction house than at a vendor"] = "背包里在拍卖行比卖给商人更值钱的物品",
    ["What in your bags sells for more at the auction house than at a vendor."] = "背包中在拍卖行比在商人处卖得更贵的物品。",
    ["What in your bags sells for more here than at a vendor, from the prices you have seen."] = "根据你见过的价格，背包中在这里比卖给商人更值钱的物品。",
    ["What is new"] = "更新内容",
    ["What is the job? /fgui checklist add daily Cooking quest"] = "是什么任务？/fgui checklist add daily 烹饪任务",
    ["what is waiting for you: crafts ready, mail on your other characters, lockouts reset, rested experience, jobs left"] = "等待你的事项：可制作的物品、其他角色的邮件、已重置的副本进度、休息经验、剩余任务",
    ["what the selected recipe still needs, counting bank and alts"] = "选中的配方还缺什么，包括银行和小号",
    ["what to show"] = "显示内容",
    ["What you changed and when, newest first. Click one to undo it."] = "你的更改及时间，最新的在前。点击一项即可撤销。",
    ["what you changed in this profile, and when; click a change to undo it"] = "你在此配置中改了什么、何时改的；点击一项可撤销",
    ["What you changed, and when. Click one to undo it."] = "你更改了什么以及何时。点击一项即可撤销。",
    ["What you have chosen so far is kept. Run it again any time from /fgui."] = "目前的选择会保留。随时可通过 /fgui 再次运行。",
    ["What your other characters carry."] = "你的其他角色携带的物品。",
    ["What's new in Fantasy Glass UI"] = "Fantasy Glass UI 新内容",
    ["What's this?"] = "这是什么？",
    ["What's this? (point at a panel)"] = "这是什么？（指向一个面板）",
    ["What's this? on and off"] = "“这是什么？”开关",
    ["What's this? Point at a panel. Esc or /fgui whatsthis to finish."] = "这是什么？指向一个面板。Esc 或 /fgui whatsthis 结束。",
    ["When a boss drops something rare or better, the players in your group who use Fantasy Glass UI each work out whether it is an upgrade for them and quietly tell the others. A small panel says whose upgrade it is and by how many item levels, before anyone rolls. Nothing is said in chat. Move it with /fgui move."] = "首领掉落稀有或更好的物品时，队伍中使用 Fantasy Glass UI 的玩家会各自判断它是否对自己有提升，并悄悄告知其他人。在任何人掷骰之前，一个小面板会显示对谁有提升、提升多少物品等级。聊天中不会显示任何内容。用 /fgui move 移动。",
    ["When a character offers exactly one thing to say and no quests, it is chosen for you. Never inside a dungeon or raid; hold Shift to choose for yourself. Presets never change this."] = "角色只提供一个对话选项且没有任务时，自动为你选择。在地下城或团队副本中绝不执行；按住 Shift 可自己选。预设从不更改此项。",
    ["When a dungeon finder or battleground invitation arrives: a sound you hear from another window, the taskbar icon flashing, and a notice."] = "收到地下城查找器或战场邀请时：在其他窗口也能听到的声音、任务栏图标闪烁和提示。",
    ["When a group roll starts for a green (uncommon) item, Greed is rolled for you. Left for you to decide: anything blue or better, anything that binds when picked up, and gear with a higher item level than what you are wearing. Presets never change this."] = "绿色（优秀）物品开始队伍掷骰时自动选择贪婪。以下由你决定：蓝色及以上、拾取后绑定的物品，以及物品等级高于当前穿戴的装备。预设从不更改此项。",
    ["When a ready check starts, lists anyone missing food, a flask or elixir, or a class buff someone in the group can give. Only outside a fight. /fgui ready shows it any time."] = "就位确认开始时，列出缺少食物、合剂或药剂、或缺少队内某人能提供的职业增益的人。仅在战斗外。/fgui ready 可随时查看。",
    ["When another add-on does the same job (bars, bags, nameplates, unit frames, chat), this one leaves that job to it and says so. /fgui conflicts off runs everything regardless."] = "当其他插件做同样的事（动作条、背包、姓名板、单位框体、聊天）时，本插件会让给它并提示。/fgui conflicts off 可照样全部运行。",
    ["When another player sends you a layout, profile or theme (/fgui send), it opens in the preview, where you choose whether to take it. Off: anything sent is ignored."] = "其他玩家向你发送布局、配置或主题（/fgui send）时，会在预览中打开，由你决定是否采用。关闭则忽略所有发送内容。",
    ["When auto-loot is in effect (your game setting, or the auto-loot key held), takes everything from a corpse at once instead of one item at a time. Presets never change this."] = "自动拾取生效时（游戏设置开启或按住自动拾取键），一次拿走尸体上的全部物品而非逐件拾取。预设从不更改此项。",
    ["When one of these buffs is on you, its icon pops up above the middle of the screen with its time left."] = "当你身上有这些增益之一时，它的图标会带着剩余时间出现在屏幕中央上方。",
    ["When panels show"] = "面板何时显示",
    ["When pointed at"] = "指向时",
    ["When someone else says your character's name in say, yell, party, raid, guild or a channel, the name is picked out in a bright color. Whispers are left alone."] = "有人在说、喊、小队、团队、公会或频道中提到你的角色名时，以醒目颜色突出。密语不受影响。",
    ["When someone pings the minimap, their name is shown on it for a moment."] = "有人点击小地图时，其名字会在上面短暂显示。",
    ["When someone starts a ready check: a sound that plays even with the game in another window, the game's icon flashing in the taskbar, and a notice saying who asked."] = "有人发起就位确认时：即使游戏在其他窗口也会响起的声音、任务栏图标闪烁，以及显示发起者的提示。",
    ["When something fails because you are mounted, you are taken off your mount, so the next press works. Never in the air and never on a flight path. Presets never change this."] = "因骑乘而失败时让你下坐骑，下一次按键即可生效。在空中或飞行路线上绝不执行。预设从不更改此项。",
    ["When something fails because you are sitting down, you are stood up, so the next press works. Presets never change this."] = "因坐着而失败时让你站起，下一次按键即可生效。预设从不更改此项。",
    ["When something goes wrong"] = "出现问题时",
    ["When the group finder asks everyone to confirm their role, yours is confirmed as you last set it. Hold Shift as the check arrives to answer it yourself. Presets never change this."] = "队伍查找器要求确认职责时，按你上次设置自动确认。确认到达时按住 Shift 可自行回答。预设从不更改此项。",
    ["When this bar shows"] = "此条何时显示",
    ["When this panel shows"] = "此面板何时显示",
    ["When you close a vendor, one line in chat says what the visit came to: what you sold, bought and repaired, and the total. It takes the place of the junk seller's and auto-repair's own lines."] = "关闭商人时，聊天中会用一行说明这次光顾的结果：卖了什么、买了什么、修理了什么，以及总计。它取代了出售垃圾和自动修理各自的消息。",
    ["When you destroy a good item the game asks you to type DELETE. This types it for you; you still press the button to confirm. Presets never change this."] = "摧毁优质物品时游戏要求输入确认词。此功能替你输入；仍需你自己点击确认。预设从不更改此项。",
    ["When you die, the last hits and heals you took, with how long before the end. /fgui death shows it again."] = "死亡时显示你最后受到的伤害和治疗，以及距离结束多久。/fgui death 可再次查看。",
    ["When you gain reputation with a faction, the reputation bar switches to that faction. Presets never change this."] = "获得某阵营声望时，声望条切换到该阵营。预设从不更改此项。",
    ["When you loot alone, the question \"Looting this item will bind it to you\" is answered for you. In a group it stays a question. Hold Shift as you loot to be asked all the same. Presets never change this."] = "独自拾取时，自动回答“拾取此物品会将其绑定给你”的询问。组队时仍会询问。拾取时按住 Shift 则照样询问。预设从不更改此项。",
    ["When you target or pull a boss, its abilities from the game's dungeon journal show one line each under your boss note, with their icons. Only on game clients with the journal, and never while you have the journal open yourself. Needs Boss notes."] = "选中或开怪时，首领在地下城手册中的技能会带图标逐行显示在你的首领笔记下方。仅限有手册的客户端，且你自己打开手册时不会读取。需要首领笔记。",
    ["Where"] = "位置",
    ["where the execute line sits on the target's health bar"] = "斩杀线在目标生命条上的位置",
    ["Where to level"] = "去哪儿练级",
    ["Where to level at %d"] = "%d 级去哪儿练级",
    ["Which guide? /fgui guide route <name> (/fgui guide lists them)."] = "哪个指南？/fgui guide route <名称>（/fgui guide 列出全部）。",
    ["which raids and dungeons each character is saved to"] = "每个角色在哪些团队副本和地下城有进度",
    ["which way home the home key would use"] = "回家键会使用哪种回家方式",
    ["While a fishing pole is equipped: sound effects at full, music and background noise down, auto-loot on. Everything goes back when the pole comes off."] = "装备鱼竿时：音效调到最大，音乐和背景音降低，自动拾取开启。取下鱼竿后一切恢复。",
    ["While recording, every quest you accept, finish and hand in becomes a step, with where you stood and who you spoke to. In chat: /fgui guide (your guides), /fgui guide record <name>, stop, edit <name>, next, back, off."] = "录制时，你接受、完成和交付的每个任务都会成为一步，并记下你所在的位置和交谈对象。聊天命令：/fgui guide（你的指南）、/fgui guide record <名称>、stop、edit <名称>、next、back、off。",
    ["While you are away: the interface fades, the camera drifts, and a panel shows session statistics."] = "离开时：界面淡出，镜头漂移，面板显示本次统计。",
    ["While you are writing a letter, lists your other characters beside the mail window. Click one to address the letter to it."] = "写信时在邮件窗口旁列出你的其他角色。点击即可填为收件人。",
    ["While you craft, the progress bar in the profession window is replaced by one in our style, and its icon is the profession's own (leatherworking, alchemy, cooking and the rest) instead of the game's placeholder. The ordinary cast bar shows the same icon while you craft."] = "制作时，专业窗口中的进度条换成我们风格的，图标为该专业自己的（制皮、炼金、烹饪等）而非游戏的占位图标。制作时普通施法条也显示同一图标。",
    ["Whisper"] = "密语",
    ["Whisper from"] = "密语来自",
    ["Whisper from %s"] = "来自 %s 的密语",
    ["Whisper from Thrall"] = "来自萨尔的密语",
    ["Whisper invites answer to the word \"%s\"."] = "密语邀请会响应关键词\"%s\"。",
    ["Whisper invites: from anyone"] = "密语邀请：任何人",
    ["Whisper window"] = "密语窗口",
    ["Whispers"] = "密语",
    ["Whispers open in a window with a tab for each conversation and a line to answer in. It never pops up during a fight. /fgui whispers opens it."] = "密语在窗口中打开，每个对话一个标签，并有一行用于回复。战斗中不会弹出。/fgui whispers 可打开。",
    ["Who covers what"] = "谁负责什么",
    ["who in your group is missing food, a flask or a class buff"] = "队伍中谁缺少食物、合剂或职业增益",
    ["who in your group is not here"] = "队伍中谁不在这里",
    ["Who is missing"] = "谁缺席",
    ["Who they have targeted (\"Targeting: YOU\" when it is you)."] = "他们的目标（是你时显示\"目标：你\"）。",
    ["Who to? /fgui send <name> [layout|profile|theme]"] = "发给谁？/fgui send <名字> [layout|profile|theme]",
    ["Whole add-on"] = "整个插件",
    ["whole screen layouts to choose from, each with a picture"] = "可选择的整屏布局，每个都配有图片",
    ["Whose upgrade"] = "对谁有提升",
    ["Whose upgrade: boss drops in a group"] = "对谁有提升：队伍中的首领掉落",
    ["Whose upgrade: in a group, a boss drop shows whose upgrade it is, and by how much, among players with the add-on - before anyone rolls."] = "对谁有提升：在队伍中，首领掉落会在掷骰前显示它对哪些使用本插件的玩家有提升，以及提升多少。",
    ["Wide screen"] = "宽屏",
    ["Width"] = "宽度",
    ["Window opacity"] = "窗口不透明度",
    ["Window opacity %"] = "窗口不透明度 %",
    ["Window positions"] = "窗口位置",
    ["Window: %s"] = "窗口：%s",
    ["Windows"] = "窗口",
    ["Windows & menus"] = "窗口与菜单",
    ["Windows close"] = "窗口关闭",
    ["Windows fade in"] = "窗口淡入",
    ["Windows fade in when they open."] = "窗口打开时淡入。",
    ["Windows fade in, alerts pop"] = "窗口淡入，提醒弹出",
    ["Windows, tooltips and quests"] = "窗口、提示与任务",
    ["wins"] = "获胜",
    ["Wishlist"] = "愿望清单",
    ["Wishlist item!"] = "愿望清单物品！",
    ["With \"Invite by whisper\" on: anyone who whispers the word is invited, not only friends and guildmates. Presets never change this."] = "开启“密语邀请”时：任何密语该词的人都会被邀请，不只是好友和公会成员。预设从不更改此项。",
    ["with a profession window open: the recipes that still give skill points, best first, with what each needs"] = "打开专业技能窗口时：仍能提升技能的配方，最好的在前，并列出各自所需",
    ["With a target"] = "有目标时",
    ["With an idle time set, the screen appears on Fantasy Glass UI's own clock. Ticking this also sets you to away at that moment, as /afk does. The game still marks you away by itself after about five minutes: no add-on can make that later."] = "设置空闲时间后，屏幕会按 Fantasy Glass UI 自己的时钟出现。勾选此项还会在那一刻把你设为暂离，就像 /afk。游戏本身约五分钟后会把你标为暂离：插件无法推迟。",
    ["With the bank open: every crafting material goes in."] = "银行打开时：所有制作材料都存入。",
    ["With the mailbox open: \"Send by my rules\" above the mail window, or /fgui mailrules send."] = "打开邮箱时：点击邮件窗口上方的\"按我的规则发送\"，或 /fgui mailrules send。",
    ["Words you choose are picked out in green in any channel, with a sound. Choose them with /fgui keyword and the word."] = "你选择的词在任何频道中以绿色突出并发出声音。用 /fgui keyword 加词设置。",
    ["work through the add-on and list what passed and what did not"] = "逐项检查插件，列出通过和未通过的项目",
    ["World map: group in class colors"] = "世界地图：队友职业颜色",
    ["Worth remembering"] = "值得记住",
    ["Worth selling"] = "值得出售",
    ["Worth selling at the auction house"] = "值得在拍卖行出售",
    ["Write a guide of your own, or paste one someone shared."] = "编写自己的指南，或粘贴别人分享的指南。",
    ["Write a reply, then press Enter"] = "写下回复，然后按回车",
    ["Write or paste a guide"] = "编写或粘贴指南",
    ["XP & reputation as numbers, not %"] = "经验与声望显示为数值而非 %",
    ["XP / reputation"] = "经验 / 声望",
    ["XP / reputation bar"] = "经验 / 声望条",
    ["yd"] = "码",
    ["Yellow: in this zone. Click one for a waypoint."] = "黄色：在此区域。点击即可设置路标。",
    ["Yellow: usually a skill point."] = "黄色：通常会提升技能。",
    ["yes"] = "是",
    ["yesterday"] = "昨天",
    ["You"] = "你",
    ["YOU"] = "你",
    ["you"] = "你",
    ["You are already in talent set %d."] = "你已在天赋方案 %d。",
    ["You are already wearing \"%s\"."] = "你已经穿着“%s”。",
    ["You are in a group: the real panels are already showing. Group practice is for when you are on your own."] = "你在队伍中：真正的面板已经在显示。队伍练习是在你独自一人时用的。",
    ["You are next to interrupt"] = "下一个由你打断",
    ["You are not following a guide."] = "你没有在跟随指南。",
    ["You are not in a group, so only you are listed."] = "你不在队伍中，所以只列出了你自己。",
    ["You are not in a group."] = "你不在队伍中。",
    ["You are using one of the game's own Edit Mode layouts, which cannot be changed. Make one of your own first: Esc, Edit Mode, the Layout menu, New Layout. Then come back here."] = "你正在使用游戏自带的编辑模式布局，它不能修改。请先新建一个自己的：Esc、编辑模式、布局菜单、新建布局。然后回到这里。",
    ["You are wearing this set"] = "你正穿着此套装",
    ["You can't delete the profile you are using."] = "不能删除正在使用的配置。",
    ["you can't use it"] = "你无法使用",
    ["You died %d time"] = "你死亡了 %d 次",
    ["You died %d times"] = "你死亡了 %d 次",
    ["You died. |cffffff00/fgui death|r shows what hit you."] = "你死了。|cffffff00/fgui death|r 显示是什么击中了你。",
    ["You gained a level."] = "你升级了。",
    ["You have %s: the marked one is the closest. Fantasy Glass UI leaves the jobs that add-on does to it."] = "你装有 %s：标记的那个最接近。Fantasy Glass UI 会把该插件负责的工作交给它。",
    ["You have arrived."] = "你已到达。",
    ["You have no hearthstone, Astral Recall or teleport."] = "你没有炉石、星界传送或传送法术。",
    ["You have no interrupt the rotation knows, so the others take turns without you."] = "你没有轮换认识的打断技能，所以其他人会不带你轮流。",
    ["You have unread mail."] = "你有未读邮件。",
    ["You received"] = "你获得了",
    ["You received %d"] = "你获得了 %d",
    ["Your bags in the order of your bag sections. Click again to stop."] = "按你的背包分区顺序排列背包。再次点击停止。",
    ["Your bank, as it was when you last opened it."] = "你的银行，保持上次打开时的样子。",
    ["Your buffs and debuffs in our style."] = "以我们的风格显示你的增益和减益。",
    ["Your characters"] = "你的角色",
    ["your characters, with level and gold, and the total"] = "你的角色，含等级和金币，以及总计",
    ["Your class color"] = "你的职业颜色",
    ["your class color"] = "你的职业颜色",
    ["Your class has no second resource to show."] = "你的职业没有可显示的第二资源。",
    ["Your current profile as a line of text you can share or keep."] = "将当前配置转为一行文本，便于分享或保存。",
    ["your daily and weekly jobs for each character; /fgui checklist add daily <job>"] = "每个角色的每日和每周任务；/fgui checklist add daily <任务>",
    ["Your daily and weekly jobs. Tick them in the checklist window (/fgui checklist); the ticks clear at the resets."] = "你的每日与每周事项。在清单窗口（/fgui checklist）中勾选；重置时清除。",
    ["your dungeon and raid runs: times, bosses, wipes, deaths and loot, with the best time for each place"] = "你的地下城和团队副本记录：用时、首领、团灭、死亡和战利品，以及每处的最佳用时",
    ["Your first boss"] = "你的第一个首领",
    ["Your first dungeon or raid run"] = "你的第一次地下城或团队副本",
    ["Your frame and your target's close to the middle, threat display just above them; party to the left."] = "你和目标的框体靠近中间，仇恨显示在其正上方；小队在左侧。",
    ["Your frame and your target's flash red on a critical hit taken, green on a critical heal."] = "受到暴击时你和目标的框体闪红，暴击治疗时闪绿。",
    ["Your frames"] = "你的框体",
    ["Your friend"] = "你的好友",
    ["Your gear is at %d%%: time for a repair."] = "你的装备耐久为 %d%%：该修理了。",
    ["Your gold at the end of each day you played this character."] = "你用此角色游戏的每天结束时的金币。",
    ["your gold day by day, and where this session's went"] = "你每天的金币，以及本次登录的金币去向",
    ["your group's roles, classes and who covers each buff"] = "你队伍的职责、职业，以及谁提供哪种增益",
    ["Your guides"] = "你的指南",
    ["Your guides, to follow or edit."] = "你的指南，可跟随或编辑。",
    ["Your guides: follow another, record, write or paste one"] = "你的指南：改跟其他、录制、编写或粘贴",
    ["Your health, power and buffs, with your target's beside them. Right-click a frame for its menu. /fgui move lets you drag any panel."] = "你的生命、能量和增益，旁边是目标的。右键点击框体打开菜单。/fgui move 可拖动任意面板。",
    ["Your hearthstone and every teleport or portal you know, on one bar with their cooldowns. Place it in move mode."] = "炉石及你掌握的所有传送和传送门，带冷却显示在一条动作条上。可在移动模式中摆放。",
    ["Your last moments, oldest first."] = "你的最后时刻，从早到晚。",
    ["Your last week"] = "你的上一周",
    ["your last week on every character: gold, time played, levels, raids and dungeons, best loot (\"this\": this week so far)"] = "你每个角色的上一周：金币、游戏时间、等级、团队副本和地下城、最佳战利品（\"this\"：本周至今）",
    ["Your lists"] = "你的列表",
    ["Your look is kept; the frames are placed for the role and the switches that suit it are on."] = "你的外观保持不变；框体按职责摆放，并开启适合的开关。",
    ["Your most worn item is at %d%%."] = "你磨损最严重的装备耐久为 %d%%。",
    ["Your notes for each boss; with a boss targeted, /fgui bossnote writes one."] = "每个首领的笔记；选中首领时 /fgui bossnote 可写一条。",
    ["Your other characters"] = "你的其他角色",
    ["your own color"] = "你自己的颜色",
    ["Your own heals over time sit in the corner of each player; the debuff icon shows the first debuff on them."] = "你的持续治疗显示在每名玩家的角落；减益图标显示其第一个减益。",
    ["Your own note on any player, shown in their tooltip and when they join your group. /fgui note and the text, with the player targeted."] = "你对任意玩家的备注，显示在其提示中及其加入队伍时。选中该玩家后输入 /fgui note 和内容。",
    ["Your own rules come first, then the sections switched on here, in the order shown. Everything else stays in the usual sections. Needs the one-window bags."] = "先应用你自己的规则，再按显示顺序应用这里开启的分区。其他物品留在原来的分区。需要单窗口背包。",
    ["Your own rules for which bag each item goes to."] = "你自己的规则：每件物品放进哪个背包。",
    ["Your own rules for which items go to which character."] = "你自己的规则：哪些物品发给哪个角色。",
    ["Your party or raid on the world map as dots in class colors; point at one for the name. The game gives no positions inside dungeons and raids."] = "在世界地图上以职业颜色圆点显示你的小队或团队；指向即可看名字。地下城和团队副本内游戏不提供位置。",
    ["Your pet is content"] = "你的宠物很满足",
    ["Your pet is happy"] = "你的宠物很开心",
    ["Your pet is unhappy"] = "你的宠物不高兴",
    ["Your quests, with the experience and gold each one gives. Click a quest to open it; the + and - fold the list."] = "你的任务，以及每个任务给的经验和金币。点击任务打开；+ 和 - 折叠列表。",
    ["Your queue is ready"] = "你的队列已就绪",
    ["Your role"] = "你的职责",
    ["Your rules"] = "你的规则",
    ["Your settings are copied before each update and at your first login each day. Pick one to see how to put it back."] = "每次更新前及每天首次登录时会复制你的设置。选择一份即可查看如何恢复。",
    ["Your settings from before the last update and from the start of the day."] = "上次更新前以及当天开始时的设置。",
    ["Your settings from StylishUI have been carried over."] = "你在 StylishUI 中的设置已迁移过来。",
    ["Your switches have been set by hand, so none of the three is marked."] = "你的开关是手动设置的，因此三项都未标记。",
    ["your target's boss note, to read or write (/fgui bossnote send: to the group; list: all of them)"] = "你目标的首领笔记，可读可写（/fgui bossnote send：发给队伍；list：全部）",
    ["Your themes"] = "你的主题",
    ["Your weekly recap is ready."] = "你的每周回顾已准备好。",
    ["Your weekly recap: what each character did last week, gold, time, levels, raids and best loot (/fgui recap)."] = "你的每周回顾：每个角色上周做了什么，金币、时间、等级、团队副本和最佳战利品（/fgui recap）。",
    ["your whole UI (profile, layout, theme, bars, mail rules) in one string to share"] = "把整个界面（配置、布局、主题、动作条、邮件规则）变成一段可分享的文字",
    ["Your whole UI in one string: Ctrl+C to copy. Anyone with Fantasy Glass UI can paste it in Profiles, Preview a shared string."] = "你的整个界面就是一段文字：Ctrl+C 复制。任何装有 Fantasy Glass UI 的人都能在配置的\"预览共享字符串\"中粘贴它。",
